<title>IRAN: Iran starts naval exercises in the Gulf.</title>
<headline>Iran starts naval exercises in the Gulf.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran launched five days of naval war games in the Gulf on Sunday which included diving and missile launching units, the Iran news agency IRNA reported.</p>
<p>It said the exercises aimed to show soldiers' combat readiness to defend Iran.</p>
